  "notes": "KOINOR Stones corner sofa in white chenille, as sold by XXXLutz: 275 × 170 cm, the recliner (\"Liege\", 117 wide and 170 deep, armrest left) and the add-on element with armrest right (158 wide). The chaise is on the left as you face the sofa, so on the right of someone sitting on it; the shop's photo shows the mirror image, and the app can't mirror an item, so this item is this version only. Koinor's flyer: height 82 cm, depth 95, seat depth 66, seat height 41; the shop lists 275 × 84 × 170 cm and a seat height of 42. model.glb is generated by `npx tsx tools/models/sofa-koinor-stones-corner-left.ts` from its own geometry after Koinor's element drawings and photos: pebble-shaped bases on small black glides, loose oval back cushions upholstered all round, and armrest pads on the bases' ends, shown at 60 cm (a ratchet sets them between 54 and 65 cm). The seat and the chaise are surfaces, so cushions can be put on them. No clearance zone: the legroom in front of the seats lies inside the item's box, beside the chaise."
